WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.208 --> 00:00:03.190
- I studied abroad in
Germany, so I know beers.

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:06.935
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:08.194 --> 00:00:09.532
- My usual is Keystone.

00:00:09.532 --> 00:00:10.624
- Keystone Light has a promotion

00:00:10.624 --> 00:00:12.412
where they put gold cans in the box

00:00:12.412 --> 00:00:14.299
and you try to find the lucky gold can.

00:00:14.849 --> 00:00:16.544
I found the gold can twice.

00:00:16.544 --> 00:00:19.880
- And they've been in
college and house parties and

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:21.678
making really good decisions.

00:00:21.678 --> 00:00:23.048
- Coors was like, my thing.

00:00:23.048 --> 00:00:24.139
- Definitely Tecate.

00:00:24.139 --> 00:00:26.367
- But don't get me a
(censor bleep)ing PBR.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:29.015
- PBR, I think, is a
legitimately delicious beer.

00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:30.338
- Bud Light, classic.

00:00:30.338 --> 00:00:31.616
- I'm from Milwaukee, I feel strongly

00:00:31.616 --> 00:00:33.474
that PBR is a good beer.

00:00:33.474 --> 00:00:35.702
- It's got a nice frothiness to it.

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:37.305
- Smells like beer pong.

00:00:37.305 --> 00:00:38.474
- I don't think this is Bud Light.

00:00:38.474 --> 00:00:39.579
- This tastes pretty good.

00:00:39.579 --> 00:00:41.217
- I'm thinking this
might be the Tecate one?

00:00:41.217 --> 00:00:41.845
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:00:41.845 --> 00:00:42.859
- Is this one Coors?
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:00:42.859 --> 00:00:43.868
- I feel like this is, like, Coors Light.

00:00:43.868 --> 00:00:44.711
(unpleasant buzzer)
- Coors Light.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:45.265
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:46.077
- This is Bud Light.
(happy bell ring)

00:00:46.077 --> 00:00:47.275
- Bet I'll know when it's Bud Light.

00:00:47.275 --> 00:00:49.518
- This one smells like feet.

00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:50.702
- It's even less flavor.

00:00:50.702 --> 00:00:52.049
- That one has a little more flavor.

00:00:52.049 --> 00:00:56.721
- This is water with,
like, a nice sour nut.

00:00:56.721 --> 00:00:58.086
- This I think is Keystone.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:00:58.086 --> 00:00:59.692
- This has to be Keystone.
(unplesant buzzer)

00:00:59.692 --> 00:01:00.617
- Coors Light.
(happy bell ring)

00:01:00.617 --> 00:01:02.092
- Coors? I don't know.
(happy bell ring)

00:01:02.912 --> 00:01:04.772
- Oh, I don't like this one at all.

00:01:04.772 --> 00:01:06.908
- I don't know, they all
taste so frickin' similar.

00:01:06.908 --> 00:01:08.418
- It has a nice oak flavor, I don't know,

00:01:08.418 --> 00:01:09.440
I don't know how they do it.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.505
- It has no flavor, except old.

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:13.527
- God, this is so hard.

00:01:13.527 --> 00:01:14.270
- Coors.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:15.035
- I have no (censor bleep)in' clue.

00:01:15.035 --> 00:01:15.849
Tecate?
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:15.849 --> 00:01:16.708
- Is that Tecate?
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:16.708 --> 00:01:17.357
- I'm gonna swirl it.

00:01:17.357 --> 00:01:18.774
- That tastes like absolutely nothing.

00:01:18.774 --> 00:01:20.817
- Man, I'm, I'm shocked at how

00:01:20.817 --> 00:01:22.234
indistinguishable these are.

00:01:22.234 --> 00:01:23.441
- This one's got some nice foam goin' on.

00:01:23.441 --> 00:01:25.020
- Elvis, did you pour all the same one

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:26.552
(man laughing off screen)
just to trick me?

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:27.806
- This one reminds me of
going on a dinner date

00:01:27.806 --> 00:01:29.176
with a guy in Silver
Lake, so I'm pretty sure

00:01:29.176 --> 00:01:30.105
this is PBR.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:30.105 --> 00:01:31.103
- Maybe this is PBR.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:31.103 --> 00:01:32.056
- I'll say this is Bud Light.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:32.056 --> 00:01:34.145
- Oh, this one's a little
darker than the others.

00:01:34.145 --> 00:01:36.096
- I can't be too indecisive,
or else I'll just get drunk.

00:01:36.096 --> 00:01:39.021
- Hmm, this one actually has a flavor.

00:01:39.021 --> 00:01:41.871
- Okay, this one tastes like a
little bit of Spanish flavor.

00:01:42.801 --> 00:01:44.594
So I'm gonna say the Tecate is this.

00:01:44.594 --> 00:01:45.661
(unpleasant buzzer)
- I like that one.

00:01:45.661 --> 00:01:46.475
- This one's pretty good.

00:01:46.475 --> 00:01:47.240
- I'll say that's Natty Light.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:47.240 --> 00:01:48.173
- This might be Stone.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:01:48.173 --> 00:01:49.354
- This one's the PBR.
(happy bell ring)

00:01:49.354 --> 00:01:50.747
- I'm gonna say this is PBR.
(happy bell ring)

00:01:50.747 --> 00:01:53.115
- (whispering) They all
start to taste the same.

00:01:53.115 --> 00:01:55.089
- Now I'm number six, I'm like, "Hey."

00:01:55.089 --> 00:01:56.675
- Oh, that one tastes like weed.

00:01:56.675 --> 00:01:59.408
- Mmm, that one's like, tangier.

00:01:59.408 --> 00:02:00.452
Maybe that one's Coors.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:02:00.452 --> 00:02:01.428
- I think it's probably Coors.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:02:01.428 --> 00:02:02.100
- PBR.
(unpleasant buzzer)

00:02:02.100 --> 00:02:03.448
- Anyone who says they can
tell the difference between

00:02:03.448 --> 00:02:06.274
all these beers, I don't trust
any of their life decisions.

00:02:07.836 --> 00:02:08.788
- Tecate?

00:02:08.788 --> 00:02:10.917
Oh, okay, well I knew I was
gonna like PBR and Tecate.

00:02:10.917 --> 00:02:11.675
- This is Keystone.

00:02:12.225 --> 00:02:14.872
No, I didn't wanna like PBR.

00:02:14.872 --> 00:02:16.473
The one thing I feel strongly about

00:02:16.473 --> 00:02:18.203
is that PBR is overrated.

00:02:18.203 --> 00:02:19.376
- Ugh, okay, I have to stop this game

00:02:19.376 --> 00:02:20.468
'cause I'm getting buzzed.

00:02:20.468 --> 00:02:22.557
This one's my favorite, I'm
pretty sure it's Keystone.

00:02:22.557 --> 00:02:24.206
Oh, maybe I like Coors Light.

00:02:24.206 --> 00:02:25.646
- This is Bud Light. (knocks on cup)

00:02:25.646 --> 00:02:26.550
This one is the best.

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:28.827
Oh, (censor bleep), all the
comments are gonna be like,

00:02:28.827 --> 00:02:30.499
"Look at these hipsters with their PBR."

00:02:30.499 --> 00:02:33.684
- This one definitely tasted
like it had the most to it.

00:02:33.684 --> 00:02:34.576
PBR.

00:02:35.326 --> 00:02:37.511
Well, I guess I like Tecate
better than I thought.

00:02:37.511 --> 00:02:39.182
- Yeah, this one's my
favorite, is it Coors?

00:02:39.182 --> 00:02:43.130
I chose the hipster beer that
I refuse to drink at parties,

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:44.684
and it's my favorite one.

00:02:44.684 --> 00:02:48.192
I've failed the hipsters,
I've failed Germany,

00:02:48.192 --> 00:02:51.602
I've failed my mom in some way, probably.

00:02:52.464 --> 00:02:54.548
- It's just so sad what's
happening over there.

00:02:54.548 --> 00:02:55.424
- Oh, yeah, mm hmm.

00:02:55.424 --> 00:02:58.134
(door slams)
(uptempo drum music)

00:02:58.134 --> 00:02:58.882
Oh.

00:02:58.882 --> 00:03:00.295
You don't know the half of it.

00:03:00.295 --> 00:03:02.420
(bossa nova music)

